{"step_index":401,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T01:16:02Z","input_tokens":2356,"cache_read_tokens":90317,"output_tokens":3524,"thinking":"NICE BizINFO frequently requires registration or paid credits, often masking information during initial page rendering. However, bizno.net, web searches, job portals (like 잡코리아, 사람인, 캐치, 리멤버), and FTC (Fair Trade Commission) communication sales reports directly provide real-time business status and business numbers linked to the National Tax Service (Hometax) DB.\n\n\nA script will be developed to systematically verify 77 companies. The process involves searching Bizno by company name, then fetching and analyzing detailed pages for matching names, representative names (considering masking), addresses (checking Busan-specific locations), and business status (active vs. closed). If a company is not found on Bizno, web searches will be employed to find communication sales details, job postings, news articles, or company websites. The verification logic involves precise matching of company name, representative (or surname similarity), and address within Busan.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nconst targets = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('target_companies.json', 'utf8'));\\n\\nfunction cleanName(n) {\\n  return n.replace(/\\\\(주\\\\)|\\\\(유한\\\\)|\\\\(유책\\\\)|\\\\(합자\\\\)|\\\\(사\\\\)/g, '').replace(/주식회사|유한회사/g, '').trim();\\n}\\n\\nasync function fetchBiznoCandidates(cleanQuery) {\\n  try {\\n    const url = `https://bizno.net/?query=${encodeURIComponent(cleanQuery)}`;\\n    const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' } });\\n    const html = await res.text();\\n    if (html.includes('0 개의 결과를 찾았습니다')) return [];\\n\\n    const postListMatch = html.match(/<div class=\\\"col-lg-8 post-list\\\">([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)<\\\\/div>\\\\s*<div class=\\\"col-lg-4 sidebar\\\">/);\\n    if (!postListMatch) return [];\\n\\n    const items = postListMatch[1].split('class=\\\"single-post');\\n    const results = [];\\n    for (let i = 1; i < items.length; i++) {\\n      const item = items[i];\\n      const art = item.match(/\\\\/article\\\\/(\\\\d{10})/)?.[1];\\n      const title = item.match(/<h4>([^<]+)<\\\\/h4>/)?.[1]?.trim() || '';\\n      if (art && title) {\\n        results.push({ art, title });\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return results;\\n  } catch (e) {\\n    return [];\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nasync function fetchBiznoDetail(art) {\\n  try {\\n    const url = `https://bizno.net/article/${art}`;\\n    const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' } });\\n    const html = await res.text();\\n\\n    // 1. Status\\n    let status = '확인불가';\\n    const s1 = html.match(/사업자 현재 상태[^:]*:\\\\s*([^\\\\s<\\\"]+)/);\\n    if (s1) status = s1[1].trim();\\n    const s2 = html.match(/<span style=\\\"color:\\\\s*red;font-weight:\\\\s*bold;\\\">([^<]+)<\\\\/span>/);\\n    if (s2) status = s2[1].trim();\\n    if (html.includes('폐업자')) {\\n      const closedMatch = html.match(/폐업자\\\\s*(?:\\\\(폐업일자\\\\s*:\\\\s*([\\\\d-]+)\\\\))?/);\\n      if (closedMatch) {\\n        status = closedMatch[1] ? `폐업 (${closedMatch[1]})` : '폐업자\n<truncated 6733 bytes>","Description":"\"Comprehensive deep verification for all 77 companies including status and detail parsing\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\parse_company_data\\\\deep_verify_all.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing deep verify script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write deep_verify_all.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
